イル等に使いたいのでお手数ですがPSDのデータで、\nキャラレイヤーだけが分かれていると助かります。\n\n使用目的:Youtube配信のサムネイル、デスクトップPCの壁紙鑑賞等\n\n資料:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-GdhDv6dQv3moZeEYIEOc3hH9F9TaKHh\n\n\n以上、ご検討の程、よろしくお願いします。", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@hassan_mofumofu/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1774639539447046144%2FtRHjxVJj.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=0cfaed95b92d4bd609722bd8c9555b25", "srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1774639539447046144%2FtRHjxVJj.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=0cfaed95b92d4bd609722bd8c9555b25, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1774639539447046144%2FtRHjxVJj.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=e1beaaec41dfe179de7ced14972c5228 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1774639539447046144%2FtRHjxVJj.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=f778e4f33a280f7e91c249ea40ee5000 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "voice", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2962116, "client_id": 3125616, "nc": 16}, {"path": "/@hassan_mofumofu/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1774639539447046144%2FtRHjxVJj.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&cro